From 10521f2a74efc9185e260d60f1d18b22015b97d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:02:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(geometry): skip the DXF CLASSES section on import

The DXF reader refused every section it did not know, so an AC1015 file
with a CLASSES section failed. CLASSES holds class records and no geometry.
The reader now consumes it to ENDSEC; other unknown sections stay refused.

Fixes #3450

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
